From 41f0d49317d158dd1f48a7dde73ed9a8a07d9646 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shunqing Chen <csq@rock-chips.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Aug 2021 18:33:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 039/232] media: i2c: rk628csi: fix audio issues

1. reset hdmi in cru when hotplug or res change to avoid audio L/R
channel swap
2. disable hdmirx and audio unit when PHY setup
3. enable audio unit after N CTS updating
4. enable audio interrupts before PHY setup
5. double init audio fifo when fifo both underflow and overflow
6. media: i2c: fix i2c access timeout
7. add 60ms delay after phy locked

Signed-off-by: Shunqing Chen <csq@rock-chips.com>
Change-Id: I2dd6862f5ed670b234898799c641724d42a91ed1
Signed-off-by: Guochun Huang <hero.huang@rock-chips.com>
